# <type>(<scope>): <short summary — imperative mood, ≤72 chars>
# │       │         └─ No period at end. Present tense. e.g. "add", not "added"
# │       └─ Optional: gateway | compliance | infra | governance | tests | docs | ci
# └─ Required: feat | fix | docs | style | refactor | perf | test | chore | ci | revert
#
# ─── Body (optional, wrap at 72 chars) ──────────────────────────────────────
#
# Explain WHAT changed and WHY (not how). Reference design decisions,
# trade-offs, or links to issues/ADRs.
#
# ─── Footer (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Breaking changes:  BREAKING CHANGE: <description>
# Issue refs:        Closes #<n>, Refs #<n>
# Co-authors:        Co-authored-by: Name <email>
#
# ─── Examples ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# feat(gateway): add Redis-backed rate limiter for OPA policy calls
# fix(compliance): correct OSCAL component UUID collision on re-export
# chore(ci): pin actions/checkout to SHA for supply-chain hardening
# docs(governance): add STPA control structure diagram to ARCHITECTURE.md
